{
  "id": "poem-3bdec42c2fef15ef568724bf",
  "title": "浣溪沙·索得玄珠也是呆",
  "author": "史浩",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "索得玄珠也是呆。",
    "人人有分莫胡猜。",
    "顶门一眼镇长开。",
    "路断玉关无辙迹，雪埋葱岭没根栽。",
    "始称达摩不曾来。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.8000.json#record-159",
